# {{BUSINESS_NAME}}: Personal Writing Rules

Your own corrections and banned words, read by the No AI Slop skill alongside its fixed kill list. This file starts almost empty and grows every time you correct a piece of writing and say "add that to my writing rules".

## Banned words

Words you never want in your copy. Each entry: the word, the abstract use to kill, and the literal use to keep.

<!-- Example:
- "leverage" as a verb. Say the concrete action instead ("use", "run on").
-->

## Corrections

Rules pulled from real corrections, in your words. Newest at the top.

<!-- Example:
- Sign off emails with "Thanks", not "Best regards".
-->
